    <DataNode elementId="CIS-3-HEXENOL" textLabel="(3Z)-hex-3-en-1-ol" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="UFLHIIWVXFIJGU-ARJAWSKDSA-N" dataSource="InChIKey" />
      <Graphics centerX="506.3770751953125" centerY="107.35269165039062" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="PMN, nilo-poyanco">(Z)-hex-3-en-1-ol is a fragrance compound used in the food and perfume industries. It has an intense grassy-green odor of freshly cut green grass and leaves. It is produced in small amounts by most plants and it acts as an attractant to many predatory insects.</Comment>
